  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/nh-rsa-data/blob/96bd0a247d4463e2ae692310c0fdd17ec563a46c/rsa_html/XXI/261/261-104.htm",
  "statuteText": "261:104 Registration. –\n\nThe department may, if it is satisfied of the facts stated in such application, grant the same and issue to the applicant a certificate of registration containing such information as the director may determine. All vehicles owned by or consigned to such manufacturer or dealer shall, while so owned or consigned, be regarded as registered under such distinguishing number."
